Hence, the appeal merits consideration, in the result, the following:
ORDER (i) Both the appeals are allowed in part;
(ii) The impugned judgment and award passed by the Tribunal is modified;
(iii) The petitioners are entitled to enhanced compensation of Rs.4,01,700/- with interest at the rate of 6% per annum on the enhanced Dhanraj J vs Mrs. Mubeena on 14 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/113375904/
6 - 13 - NC: 2024:KHC:32987 compensation from the date of petition till its realization;
